#: configlist.cpp:232
msgid "Option"
msgstr "Opcija"

#: configlist.cpp:233
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Vrijednost"

#: configparser.cpp:483
msgid ""
"No hardware architecture was specified! Perhaps the kernel source code is "
"not installed on this system, or the path to the kernel sources is entered "
"incorrectly."
msgstr "Nije navedena hardverska arhitektura! Možda izvorni kod kernela nije instaliran na ovom sistemu ili je put do izvornog koda pogrešno unesen."

#: configparser.cpp:493
msgid "Linux kernel versions 2.5 and above are not yet supported."
msgstr "Verzija 2.5 Linux kernela i veće još uvijek nisu podržane."

#: configparser.cpp:676
msgid "cannot open %1 for reading"
msgstr "ne mogu čitati iz %1"

#: configuration.cpp:98
msgid "Are you sure you want to overwrite your existing kernel configuration in %1?"
msgstr ""
"Da li ste sigurni da želite da pišete preko postojeće kernel "
"konfiguracije u %1?"

#: configuration.cpp:111
msgid ""
"You do not have sufficient permissions to write to %1\n"
"Do you want to write the configuration to a different file instead?"
msgstr ""
"Vi nemate potrebne privilegije za pisanje u %1\n"
"Da li želite da sačuvate konfiguraciju u nekoj drugoj datoteci?"

#: configuration.cpp:123
msgid "Do you really want to reset all kernel options to their default values?"
msgstr "Da li zaista želite da vratite sve kernel opcije na default vrijednosti?"

#: configuration.cpp:149
msgid ""
"_: Error message\n"
"<p>%1</p>"
msgstr "<p>%1</p>"

#: configuration.cpp:155
msgid ""
"<p>%1, line %2:</p>\n"
"<pre>%3<span style=\"color: red\">%4</span>%5\n"
"%6^ %7</pre>"
msgstr ""
"<p>%1, red %2:</p>\n"
"<pre>%3<span style=\"color: red\">%4</span>%5\n"
"%6^ %7</pre>"

#: configuration.cpp:168
msgid ""
"<p>Either your kernel sources contain invalid configuration rules or you "
"just found a bug in the KDE Kernel Configurator.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>"
"Ili vaš kernel sadrži nepravilna konfiguracijska pravila ili ste možda "
"upravo našli grešku u KDE kernel konfiguracijskom alatu.</p>"

#: configuration.cpp:184
msgid "The kernel configuration could not be read due to the following error:"
msgstr "Vaša konfiguracija kernela nije mogla biti učitana zbog sljedeće greške:"

#: configuration.cpp:185
msgid "The kernel configuration could not be read due to the following errors:"
msgstr ""
"Vaša konfiguracija kernela nije mogla biti učitana zbog sljedećih "
"grešaka:"

#: configuration.cpp:239
msgid "Linux Kernel Configurator"
msgstr "Podešavanje Linux kernela"

#: configuration.cpp:240
msgid "Option is disabled"
msgstr "Opcija je isključena"

#: configuration.cpp:241
msgid "Option is enabled"
msgstr "Opcija je uključena"

#: configuration.cpp:242
msgid "Compiled as a module"
msgstr "Kompajlirano kao modul"

#: configuration.cpp:327
msgid ""
"Your kernel configuration has been saved.\n"
"You need to run 'make symlinks dep' now."
msgstr ""
"Vaša konfiguracija kernela je sačuvana.\n"
"Sada pokrenite 'make symlinks dep'."

#: configuration.cpp:331
msgid ""
"Your kernel configuration has been saved.\n"
"You may run 'make bzImage', 'make bzDisk' or 'make install' now."
msgstr ""
"Vaša konfiguracija kernela je sačuvana.\n"
"Sada pokrenite 'make bzImage', 'make bzDisk' ili 'make install'."

#: configuration.cpp:337
msgid ""
"Your kernel configuration has been saved.\n"
"The file %1, which is needed for the kernel build could not be written "
"though.\n"
"Please run 'make oldconfig'."
msgstr ""
"Vaša konfiguracija kernela je sačuvana.\n"
"Ali datoteka %1, koja je potrebna u gradnji kernela, nije mogla biti "
"zapisana. \n"
"Molim vas pokrenite 'make oldconfig'."

#: configuration.cpp:344
msgid "Your kernel configuration has been saved."
msgstr "Vaša konfiguracija kernela je sačuvana."

#: configuration.cpp:349
msgid "The kernel configuration could not be saved."
msgstr "Vaša konfiguracija kernela nije mogla biti sačuvana."

